<title>FINLAND: FINNISH 2004 BOND YIELDS 5.53 PCT AT AUCTION.</title>
<headline>FINNISH 2004 BOND YIELDS 5.53 PCT AT AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/93 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-03-2004</p>
<p> COUPON:				 9.50 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.53 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  121.30</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,160 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 1,240 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 2,063 million markka at a price of 121.55 and a yield of 5.55 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 48,995 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
